  "notable_quotes": [
    "Synergistic sorbent separation technology can produce high-purity C2H4 from a four-component C2H2/C2H4/C2H6/CO2 mixture by sequential impurity adsorption on multiple sorbents.",
    "A simpler one-sorbent separation strategy could overcome SSST issues, but it requires a single sorbent with multiple molecular recognition abilities.",
    "Before this work, no adsorbent had documented preferential adsorption of C2H2, C2H6, CO2, C3H4, C3H6, and C3H8 over C2H4 from a seven-component mixture."
